 “MEP Connect – 1 Tap Service App”

A fast, simple platform where customers instantly connect with nearby verified technicians.

1. Home Screen (Simple & Clean UI)

Search bar: “What service do you need?”

Icons for each category:

Electrical

Plumbing

AC Repair

Civil Work

Carpenter

Cleaning

Painting

CCTV Installation

RO, Geyser, Solar

“Emergency Service” button

“Book Later” button

Service offers & promotions

2. Customer App Features (Easy Use for All Ages)

  1. Quick Service Booking

Customers choose:

Category

Problem description

Upload photo/video

Select date/time

Set location from GPS

  2. Live Technician Matching

When customer books:

App finds nearest available technician

Technician accepts/rejects

Customer gets ETA and technician details

 3. Real-Time Tracking

Live map tracking:

Technician distance

Estimated time

Technician rating

Skill badges

 4. In-App Chat & Call

Customers can:

Chat

Send photos

Call technician (masked number)

 5. Transparent Pricing

Show:

Minimum charge

Service charge

Spare parts price list

GST

Discounts

 6. Secure Payments

UPI

Wallet

Cash

Card

 7. Technician Rating & Review

After service:

Star rating

Comment

Photo review

 8. Complaint & Refund System

Easy complaint submission
Auto-refund if job not done properly

 3. Technician App Features (Super Simple UI)

 1. Technician Profile

Shows:

Skills

Experience

ID verification

Certifications

Rating

 2. Job Dashboard

Technician sees:

New jobs

Active jobs

Completed jobs

Cancelled jobs 

3. Easy Job Acceptance

One-tap “Accept Job”
Shows:

Customer location

Service type

Estimated payment

 4. Navigation (Google Maps Integration)

Open maps directly from the job page.

 5. In-App Chat/Call with Customer

 6. Earnings Dashboard

Technician can see:

Daily earnings

Monthly earnings

Subscription status

Withdrawal balance

 7. Subscription / Commission System

Technicians can:

Subscribe monthly

Pay yearly for discount

View commission details

